- Public Repos: {{ $json.github_enrichment.public_repos }}
- Languages (by bytes): {{ JSON.stringify($json.github_enrichment.languages) }}
- Frameworks Detected: {{ JSON.stringify($json.github_enrichment.frameworks_detected) }}
